{"id":"roma_ntico","lemma":"romántico","pos":"adj","rank":1936,"glosses":["romantic"],"ipa":"/roˈmantiko/","forms":{"feminine":"romántica","masculinePlural":"románticos","femininePlural":"románticas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/10/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-rom%C3%A1ntico.wav","examples":[{"text":"Era tan romántico.","en":"It was so romantic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448428","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},null]},{"text":"¿Cuál es tu película romántica preferida?","en":"What's your favorite romantic movie?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589922","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"film"},null,{"g":"preferred, of choice","l":"preferido"}]},{"text":"Sabía que eras un romántico.","en":"I knew you were a romantic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152296","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"era, age","l":"era"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Las niñas son más románticas que los niños.","en":"Girls are more romantic than boys.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"girl","l":"niña"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"}]},{"text":"Sólo quiero hacerte saber que yo tengo una cita romántica.","en":"I just wanted to let you know I have a date.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586904","words":[null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"to know, to understand"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"date"},null]}]}